  "description": "YITAMOTOR 48\" Skid Steer Pallet forks Blades. This skid steer pallet forks blade has 4000 lbs Bearing Capacity, Can easily and quickly haul lumber, and firewood, move fence posts, hay bales, etc.\nFitment\nThe frontier pallet fork compatible with Bobcat Skid Steer, New Holland and Kubota tractors; Ideal for handling most farm, factory, warehouse and construction site work .\nFor your safety, professional installation is recommended.\nFeatures\nQuality Steel: YITAMOTOR skid steer pallet fork frame is made from heavy-duty grade 50 steel that can withstand up to 4,000 pounds pulling force, enabling you to effortlessly carry heavy objects\nDouble Protection: The joint use of powder coating and painted finish makes us stand out from other single finish applied alternatives; This double application grants a robust & smooth surface that has excellent rust & scratch resistance\nAdjustable Pallet Fork Blades: The pallet fork frame is a quick connect skid steer that can be directly installed to the machine. The pallet fork blade can be freely moved on the skid steer frame, and the distance can be adjusted within a 17\"-37\" range on the frame; The extended top bracket reduces timber slipping risk during handling\nExtensive Compatibility: Suitable for most loaders and tractors; Compatible with Bobcat Skid Steer, New Holland and Kubota tractors; Ideal for handling most farm, factory, warehouse and construction site work\nSpecifications and Reliable Service: The pallet fork frame's total weight: 136 lbs, total length: 45\", total height: 35\"; The total weight of pallet forks: 198.4 lbs, length: 48\", width: 4\", height: 22\".",
